msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:1
msgid ""
":math:`G_{max} = \\bar v_{Jet} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\Pi_{JetRound} \\bar v_{Jet} "
