msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:1
msgid ""
":math:`G_{max} = \\bar v_{Jet}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\Pi_{FlocBaffle} \\bar "
"v_{Jet}}{\\nu S_{Jet}}}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:132
msgid ""
"For mechanical mixing where an impeller or other stirring device is adding "
"shaft work to a control volume we have"
msgstr ""
"Para la mezcla mecánica, donde un impulsor u otro dispositivo de agitación "
"añade trabajo de eje a un volumen de control, tenemos"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:134
msgid ""
"\\bar\\varepsilon = \\frac{P}{m} = \\frac{P}{\\rho \\forall}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:136
msgid "where"
msgstr "donde"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:137
msgid ":math:`P` = power input into the control volume"
msgstr ":math:`P` = entrada de potencia en el volumen de control"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:138
msgid ":math:`m` = mass of fluid in the control volume"
msgstr ":math:`m` = masa de fluido en el volumen de control"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:139
msgid ":math:`\\forall` = volume of the control volume"
msgstr ":math:`\\forall` = volumen del volumen de control"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:140
msgid ":math:`\\rho` = density of the fluid"
msgstr ":math:`\\rho` = densidad del fluido"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:142
msgid "The Camp-Stein velocity gradient for a mechanically mixed reactor is"
msgstr "El gradiente de velocidad Camp-Stein para un reactor mecánicamente mixto es"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Intro.rst:144
msgid ""
"\\tilde{G} = \\sqrt{\\frac{P}{\\rho \\nu \\forall}}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

